        }
      ],
      "properties": {
        "cnr_id": "pysssss.custom_scripts",
        "ver": "1.0.0",
        "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "<think>The user wants a T2VA (text-to-video with audio) prompt for a 5-second video. The subject is a female police officer on an American street corner observing her surroundings.\n\nLet me craft this following H3 rules:\n- Output language: Simplified Chinese for descriptive prose\n- Keep H3 field names, [Shot N], At MM:SS.mmm in English\n- No attached media to analyze\n- 5-second duration\n- AUTO shot count - for 5 seconds, 1 shot is appropriate, maybe 1 shot with camera movement\n\nLet me write a concise but complete prompt.</think>\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] 在美国城市的街角，阳光斜照在斑马线和斑驳的砖石路面上，一名身穿深蓝色制服的女警站在路灯柱旁，胸前佩戴银色警徽，腰间别着对讲机和警用手枪皮套。她警觉地环顾四周，先是缓缓将视线投向左侧街道，镜头轻微左移跟随她的目光，随后她微微侧头看向右侧人行道，镜头顺势右转，最后她转向前方街道尽头，警觉的眼神中带着一丝严肃。微风吹动她齐肩的深棕色头发和制服衬衫下摆，远处传来城市街道的环境声响。\n\noverall_soundscape: 城市街角的环境音，包含远处的汽车引擎声、偶尔的鸣笛声、行人稀疏的脚步声，以及轻柔的风声和树叶沙沙声。\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A"
      ]
    },
